    scienceSub: "プラズマスパーク破壊過程、ユゴニオ衝撃波方程式、筋原線維Z帯の微視的破壊メカニズム、二次キャビテーションマイクロジェット、耐圧防音設計。",
    tableTitle: "食肉軟化・細胞破壊技術の産業比較ベンチマーク"
  }
};

const d = DICT[lang] || DICT.en;
const systems = hvpData.hvpSystems;
const substrates = hvpData.foodSubstrates;
const benchmarks = hvpData.industrialTenderizationBenchmarks;
---

<div class="space-y-10" id="hvp-modeler-container">
  <!-- Header Card -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-indigo-950 to-slate-900 border border-indigo-800/40 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 text-white shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute -right-20 -bottom-20 w-80 h-80 bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/20 border border-cyan-400/40 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-cyan-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
        </svg>
        {d.badge}
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-3">
        {d.title}
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-4xl">
        {d.subtitle}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Interactive Simulator Grid -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8">
    <!-- Controls (5 cols) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
      <div class="bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-xs space-y-5">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">{d.controlsTitle}</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">{d.controlsSub}</p>
        </div>

        <!-- System Select -->
        <div class="space-y-1.5">
          <label for="hvp-system-select" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-ink uppercase tracking-wider">
            {d.systemLabel}
          </label>
          <select 
            id="hvp-system-select" 
            class="w-full bg-surface-elevated border border-hairline rounded-xl px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-500 transition-colors"
          >
            {systems.map((s, idx) => (
              <option value={s.id} selected={idx === 0}>{s.name}</option>
            ))}
          </select>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted">{d.systemHelp}</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Substrate Select -->
        <div class="space-y-1.5">
          <label for="hvp-substrate-select" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-ink uppercase tracking-wider">
            {d.substrateLabel}
          </label>
          <select 
            id="hvp-substrate-select" 
            class="w-full bg-surface-elevated border border-hairline rounded-xl px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-500 transition-colors"
          >
            {substrates.map((sub, idx) => (
              <option value={sub.id} selected={idx === 0}>{sub.name}</option>
            ))}
          </select>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted">{d.substrateHelp}</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Voltage Slider -->
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs">
            <label for="hvp-voltage-input" class="font-semibold text-ink">{d.voltageLabel}</label>
            <span id="hvp-voltage-val" class="font-mono font-bold text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400">42.0 kV</span>
          </div>
          <input 
            type="range" 
            id="hvp-voltage-input" 
            min="30" 
            max="55" 
            step="0.5" 
            value="42" 
            class="w-full accent-cyan-600 cursor-pointer"
          />
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted">{d.voltageHelp}</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Energy per Pulse Slider -->
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs">
            <label for="hvp-energy-input" class="font-semibold text-ink">{d.energyLabel}</label>
            <span id="hvp-energy-val" class="font-mono font-bold text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400">18.0 kJ</span>
          </div>
          <input 
            type="range" 
            id="hvp-energy-input" 
            min="5" 
            max="30" 
            step="0.5" 
            value="18" 
            class="w-full accent-cyan-600 cursor-pointer"
          />
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted">{d.energyHelp}</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Frequency Slider -->
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs">
            <label for="hvp-freq-input" class="font-semibold text-ink">{d.freqLabel}</label>
            <span id="hvp-freq-val" class="font-mono font-bold text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400">4.0 Hz</span>
          </div>
          <input 
            type="range" 
            id="hvp-freq-input" 
            min="1" 
            max="8" 
            step="0.5" 
            value="4" 
            class="w-full accent-cyan-600 cursor-pointer"
          />
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted">{d.freqHelp}</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Pulse Dose Slider -->
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs">
            <label for="hvp-pulses-input" class="font-semibold text-ink">{d.pulsesLabel}</label>
            <span id="hvp-pulses-val" class="font-mono font-bold text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400">24 pulses</span>
          </div>
          <input 
            type="range" 
            id="hvp-pulses-input" 
            min="4" 
            max="50" 
            step="1" 
            value="24" 
            class="w-full accent-cyan-600 cursor-pointer"
          />
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted">{d.pulsesHelp}</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Presets -->
        <div class="pt-3 border-t border-hairline/60 space-y-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-ink uppercase tracking-wider block">{d.presetsTitle}</span>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1.5">
            <button type="button" class="hvp-preset-btn text-left px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-elevated hover:bg-cyan-50 dark:hover:bg-cyan-950/40 border border-hairline text-[11px] font-medium text-ink transition-colors" data-preset="beef">
              🥩 {d.presetBeef}
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="hvp-preset-btn text-left px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-elevated hover:bg-cyan-50 dark:hover:bg-cyan-950/40 border border-hairline text-[11px] font-medium text-ink transition-colors" data-preset="poultry">
              🍗 {d.presetPoultry}
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="hvp-preset-btn text-left px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-elevated hover:bg-cyan-50 dark:hover:bg-cyan-950/40 border border-hairline text-[11px] font-medium text-ink transition-colors" data-preset="pomace">
              🍇 {d.presetPomace}
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="hvp-preset-btn text-left px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-elevated hover:bg-cyan-50 dark:hover:bg-cyan-950/40 border border-hairline text-[11px] font-medium text-ink transition-colors" data-preset="oyster">
              🦪 {d.presetOyster}
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="hvp-preset-btn text-left px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-elevated hover:bg-red-50 dark:hover:bg-red-950/40 border border-hairline text-[11px] font-medium text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 transition-colors" data-preset="hazard">
              ⚠️ {d.presetHazard}
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Outputs & Telemetry (7 cols) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
      <div class="bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-xs space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-hairline pb-4">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">{d.diagnosticTitle}</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-0.5">{d.diagnosticSub}</p>
          </div>
          <span id="hvp-status-badge" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-950 dark:text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-300 dark:border-emerald-700">
            OPTIMAL TENDERIZATION
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Telemetry Cards Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <!-- Peak Pressure -->
          <div class="bg-surface-elevated border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1">
            <span class="text-xs text-muted font-medium">{d.pressureLabel}</span>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span id="out-peak-pressure" class="text-2xl font-black font-mono text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400">242 MPa</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-muted font-mono">(2,420 bar)</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-muted">Acoustic shock amplitude at focus</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Shock Velocity -->
          <div class="bg-surface-elevated border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1">
            <span class="text-xs text-muted font-medium">{d.velocityLabel}</span>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span id="out-shock-velocity" class="text-2xl font-black font-mono text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400">1,780 m/s</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-muted font-mono">(Mach 1.18 in water)</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-muted">Supersonic Hugoniot wave velocity</p>
          </div>

          <!-- WBSF Shear Force -->
          <div class="bg-surface-elevated border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1">
            <span class="text-xs text-muted font-medium">{d.wbsfLabel}</span>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span id="out-wbsf-reduction" class="text-2xl font-black font-mono text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">-43.5%</span>
              <span id="out-wbsf-newtons" class="text-xs font-mono text-ink">33.1 N</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-muted">Initial: 58.5 N &bull; Retail Target: &lt; 38 N</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Myofibrillar Disruption -->
          <div class="bg-surface-elevated border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1">
            <span class="text-xs text-muted font-medium">{d.disruptionLabel}</span>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span id="out-disruption-index" class="text-2xl font-black font-mono text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">89.2%</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-muted font-mono">Zp = 0.89</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-muted">I-band Z-disk structural cleavage</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Acoustic Energy Flux -->
          <div class="bg-surface-elevated border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1">
            <span class="text-xs text-muted font-medium">{d.fluxLabel}</span>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span id="out-energy-flux" class="text-2xl font-black font-mono text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400">14.8 J/cm²</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-muted font-mono">per pulse</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-muted">Focal acoustic power density</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Surface Microbial Log Reduction -->
          <div class="bg-surface-elevated border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1">
            <span class="text-xs text-muted font-medium">{d.microbialLabel}</span>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span id="out-microbial-log" class="text-2xl font-black font-mono text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400">2.35 log</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-muted font-mono">CFU/cm²</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-muted">Spark UV flash + •OH radical kill</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Net Energy SEC -->
          <div class="bg-surface-elevated border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1">
            <span class="text-xs text-muted font-medium">{d.energySecLabel}</span>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span id="out-net-sec" class="text-2xl font-black font-mono text-ink">14.4 kJ/kg</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-muted font-mono">(0.004 kWh/kg)</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-muted">&gt;90% energy reduction vs HPP</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Noise Containment Margin -->
          <div class="bg-surface-elevated border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1">
            <span class="text-xs text-muted font-medium">{d.noiseLabel}</span>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span id="out-noise-level" class="text-2xl font-black font-mono text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">73.5 dBA</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-muted font-mono">(OSHA &lt; 85 dBA)</span>
            </div>
            <p id="out-noise-desc" class="text-[10px] text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold">11.5 dBA OSHA safety headroom</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Real-Time Evaluation Box -->
        <div id="hvp-evaluation-box" class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-cyan-950/20 border border-cyan-800/40 text-xs leading-relaxed space-y-1.5 text-slate-300">
          <div class="font-bold text-cyan-300 flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
            <span id="hvp-eval-title">Optimal Meat Tenderization Window</span>
          </div>
          <p id="hvp-eval-desc">
            Underwater spark discharge creates a focused 242 MPa shockwave pulse with 2.5 µs rise time. Acoustic impedance coupling through the sanitary polyurethane membrane fractures myofibrillar Z-disks and weakens collagen without thermal denaturing or excessive drip loss (purge loss &lt; 1.2%).
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Interactive SVG Flow Architecture Diagram -->
  <div class="bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-xs space-y-6">
    <div class="border-b border-hairline pb-4">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">{d.diagramTitle}</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">{d.diagramSub}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="w-full overflow-x-auto">
      <div class="min-w-[800px] p-6 bg-slate-950 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 text-white font-sans">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 920 460" class="w-full h-auto select-none">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="hvpArcGrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
              <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#38bdf8" />
              <stop offset="50%" stop-color="#ffffff" />
              <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#0284c7" />
            </linearGradient>
            <radialGradient id="hvpShockGlow" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="50%">
              <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#38bdf8" stop-opacity="0.9" />
              <stop offset="40%" stop-color="#0284c7" stop-opacity="0.5" />
              <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#0284c7" stop-opacity="0" />
            </radialGradient>
            <linearGradient id="meatGrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
              <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#b91c1c" />
              <stop offset="50%" stop-color="#dc2626" />
              <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#991b1b" />
            </linearGradient>
            <filter id="glowFilter" x="-20%" y="-20%" width="140%" height="140%">
              <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="4" result="blur" />
              <feComposite in="SourceGraphic" in2="blur" operator="over" />
            </filter>
          </defs>

          <!-- System Background Outer Enclosure -->
          <rect x="20" y="30" width="880" height="400" rx="16" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#334155" stroke-width="2" />
          <text x="40" y="60" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" letter-spacing="1">
            ASME SECTION VIII DIV 1 / SANITARY FLOW-THROUGH SHOCKWAVE REACTOR (AISI 316L)
          </text>

          <!-- Module 1: High Voltage Pulse Generator -->
          <rect x="50" y="90" width="200" height="310" rx="12" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#0284c7" stroke-width="1.5" />
          <text x="70" y="120" fill="#38bdf8" font-size="13" font-weight="bold">HV Pulse Modulator</text>
          <text x="70" y="140" fill="#64748b" font-size="10">High-Voltage Capacitor Bank</text>

          <!-- Capacitor Bank Details -->
          <rect x="70" y="160" width="160" height="50" rx="6" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#475569" />
          <text x="80" y="185" fill="#f8fafc" font-size="11" font-weight="bold">30–55 kV DC Charging</text>
          <text x="80" y="200" fill="#38bdf8" font-size="9" font-mono>E = 1/2 C·V² (15–30 kJ)</text>

          <!-- Solid-State Spark Gap Switch -->
          <rect x="70" y="225" width="160" height="45" rx="6" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#475569" />
          <text x="80" y="247" fill="#f8fafc" font-size="11" font-weight="bold">Triggered Spark Gap</text>
          <text x="80" y="262" fill="#38bdf8" font-size="9">Rise Time: 1.5–3.0 µs</text>

          <!-- Safety Ground Crowbar -->
          <rect x="70" y="285" width="160" height="45" rx="6" fill="#0f172a" stroke="#475569" />
          <text x="80" y="307" fill="#10b981" font-size="11" font-weight="bold">Grounded Safety Dump</text>
          <text x="80" y="322" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="9">Auto-Discharge Crowbar</text>

          <!-- High Voltage Coaxial Cables -->
          <path d="M 250 185 L 320 185 L 320 180 L 360 180" fill="none" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="6 3" />
          <text x="260" y="175" fill="#ef4444" font-size="10" font-weight="bold">42 kV HV Pulse</text>

          <!-- Module 2: Submerged Spark Chamber with Parabolic Reflector -->
          <rect x="360" y="90" width="240" height="310" rx="12" fill="#131c31" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="1.5" />
          <text x="380" y="120" fill="#38bdf8" font-size="13" font-weight="bold">Acoustic Reflector Chamber</text>
          <text x="380" y="138" fill="#64748b" font-size="10">Submerged Spark Gap (W-Re)</text>

          <!-- Parabolic Reflector Arc -->
          <path d="M 390 150 Q 480 150 480 230 Q 480 310 390 310" fill="none" stroke="#e2e8f0" stroke-width="3" />
          <text x="400" y="170" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="9">Parabolic Acoustic Reflector</text>

          <!-- Spark Discharge Point -->
          <circle cx="430" cy="230" r="18" fill="url(#hvpShockGlow)" filter="url(#glowFilter)" />
          <polygon points="426,220 434,228 428,232 433,240 424,231 430,227" fill="url(#hvpArcGrad)" />
          <text x="390" y="255" fill="#ffffff" font-size="10" font-weight="bold">Plasma Arc</text>

          <!-- Acoustic Shockwaves Propagating Right -->
          <path d="M 460 190 Q 510 230 460 270" fill="none" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="2.5" opacity="0.8" />
          <path d="M 490 170 Q 550 230 490 290" fill="none" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="2.5" opacity="0.6" />
          <path d="M 520 150 Q 590 230 520 310" fill="none" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.4" />
          <text x="495" y="225" fill="#38bdf8" font-size="11" font-weight="bold">242 MPa Shock</text>

          <!-- Module 3: Sanitary Acoustic Isolation Membrane -->
          <line x1="600" y1="120" x2="600" y2="370" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="4 2" />
          <text x="560" y="395" fill="#10b981" font-size="10" font-weight="bold">Acoustic Polyurethane Membrane</text>

          <!-- Module 4: Continuous Food Conveyor Chamber -->
          <rect x="630" y="90" width="240" height="310" rx="12" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1.5" />
          <text x="650" y="120" fill="#f8fafc" font-size="13" font-weight="bold">Continuous Conveyor Line</text>
          <text x="650" y="138" fill="#64748b" font-size="10">USDA FSIS Sanitary Dwell Zone</text>

          <!-- Conveyor Belt -->
          <rect x="645" y="270" width="210" height="12" rx="3" fill="#334155" stroke="#475569" />
          <circle cx="660" cy="292" r="8" fill="#475569" />
          <circle cx="840" cy="292" r="8" fill="#475569" />

          <!-- Meat Cuts on Conveyor -->
          <!-- Tough Meat Before Focus -->
          <g transform="translate(655, 230)">
            <rect x="0" y="0" width="55" height="34" rx="6" fill="url(#meatGrad)" stroke="#7f1d1d" />
            <text x="8" y="20" fill="#ffffff" font-size="9" font-weight="bold">Tough</text>
            <text x="6" y="30" fill="#fca5a5" font-size="7">58.5 N</text>
          </g>

          <!-- Meat Cut in Acoustic Focus Zone -->
          <g transform="translate(720, 225)">
            <rect x="0" y="0" width="60" height="38" rx="6" fill="#dc2626" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="2" />
            <circle cx="30" cy="19" r="22" fill="none" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 2" />
            <text x="10" y="18" fill="#ffffff" font-size="9" font-weight="bold">Shock Impact</text>
            <text x="12" y="29" fill="#38bdf8" font-size="8" font-weight="bold">Zp = 0.89</text>
          </g>

          <!-- Tender Meat After Focus -->
          <g transform="translate(790, 232)">
            <rect x="0" y="0" width="55" height="32" rx="6" fill="#15803d" stroke="#166534" />
            <text x="8" y="18" fill="#ffffff" font-size="9" font-weight="bold">Tender</text>
            <text x="8" y="28" fill="#86efac" font-size="7">-43.5% WBSF</text>
          </g>

          <!-- Direction Arrow -->
          <path d="M 660 325 L 830 325" fill="none" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />
          <polygon points="830,320 840,325 830,330" fill="#38bdf8" />
          <text x="700" y="342" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="10">Continuous Flow (1,800 kg/h)</text>

          <!-- Acoustic Resonator Baffle & Noise Damper Jacket -->
          <rect x="345" y="75" width="540" height="340" rx="16" fill="none" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="8 4" />
          <text x="680" y="430" fill="#10b981" font-size="10" font-weight="bold">
            Dual-Wall Acoustic Attenuation Jacket (&lt; 74 dBA at 1 m)
          </text>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Scientific Principles & Engineering In-Depth -->
  <div class="bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-xs space-y-6">
    <div class="border-b border-hairline pb-4">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">{d.scienceTitle}</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">{d.scienceSub}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-ink flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 dark:bg-cyan-950 dark:text-cyan-300 inline-flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">1</span>
          Electrohydraulic Spark Breakdown Physics
        </h4>
        <p>
          Underwater high-voltage pulsed arc discharge (HVP)—also termed high-voltage electrical discharge (HED) or electrohydraulic treatment—initiates when a high-voltage capacitor bank (30 to 55 kV) discharges stored electrical energy (E = 0.5 &middot; C &middot; V&sup2;, 10 to 30 kJ per pulse) across submerged spark-gap electrodes. Within nanoseconds (&lt; 100 ns), localized electron Townsend avalanches trigger dielectric breakdown in liquid water, creating an ionized plasma filament reaching temperatures of 10,000 to 15,000 K and internal pressures exceeding 1,000 MPa (10,000 bar).
        </p>
        <p>
          The instantaneous thermal expansion of this confined plasma column acts as an explosive acoustic piston, launching a high-intensity spherical shockwave into the surrounding aqueous couplant. The shockwave propagates at supersonic speeds (u<sub>s</sub> &asymp; 1,600 to 2,100 m/s), governed by the Rankine-Hugoniot hydrodynamic equations:
        </p>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-elevated border border-hairline font-mono text-xs text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-300">
          u<sub>s</sub> = c<sub>0</sub> + s &middot; u<sub>p</sub> &emsp;|&emsp; P<sub>peak</sub> = &rho;<sub>0</sub> &middot; c<sub>0</sub> &middot; u<sub>p</sub> + &rho;<sub>0</sub> &middot; s &middot; u<sub>p</sub>&sup2;
        </div>
        <p>
          where c<sub>0</sub> &asymp; 1,500 m/s is the acoustic sound speed in water, u<sub>p</sub> is particle velocity, and s &asymp; 1.92 is the empirical water shock Hugoniot coefficient.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-ink flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 dark:bg-cyan-950 dark:text-cyan-300 inline-flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">2</span>
          Myofibrillar Fragmentation &amp; Acoustic Impedance Matching
        </h4>
        <p>
          Unlike static high-pressure processing (HPP) which relies on slow hydrostatic equilibrium (400–600 MPa for several minutes), HVP delivers dynamic acoustic shockwaves with steep rise times (2.0 to 4.5 µs) and pulse durations under 40 µs. Because muscle tissue and water possess closely matched acoustic impedances (Z<sub>water</sub> = 1.50 &times; 10<sup>6</sup> Rayls vs. Z<sub>muscle</sub> = 1.62 &times; 10<sup>6</sup> Rayls), over 99.8% of the acoustic pressure energy transmits directly into the meat without reflective bounce:
        </p>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-elevated border border-hairline font-mono text-xs text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300">
          T = 4 &middot; Z<sub>1</sub> &middot; Z<sub>2</sub> / (Z<sub>1</sub> + Z<sub>2</sub>)&sup2; = 4(1.50)(1.62) / (3.12)&sup2; = 0.9985 &emsp; (99.85% Transmission)
        </div>
        <p>
          As the supersonic compression wave sweeps through muscle fibers, differential shear strains tear brittle structural components—specifically the actin-myosin cross-bridges at the I-band and Z-disks—and rupture connective endomysial sheaths. This achieves an immediate 35% to 50% decrease in Warner-Bratzler Shear Force (WBSF), converting tough utility cuts (beef eye of round, chuck roll, spent laying hen fowl) into tender table-grade cuts without thermal protein denaturation or moisture loss.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-ink flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 dark:bg-cyan-950 dark:text-cyan-300 inline-flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">3</span>
          Rayleigh-Plesset Cavitation &amp; Secondary Micro-Jets
        </h4>
        <p>
          Following primary shockwave propagation, the expanding plasma gas bubble reaches a maximum radius (R<sub>max</sub> &asymp; 15 to 25 mm) and undergoes rapid oscillation and collapse governed by the Rayleigh-Plesset bubble dynamic equation:
        </p>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-elevated border border-hairline font-mono text-xs text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-300">
          R &middot; (d&sup2;R/dt&sup2;) + 1.5 &middot; (dR/dt)&sup2; = (1/&rho;) &middot; [ P<sub>B</sub>(R, t) - P<sub>&infin;</sub>(t) - 2&sigma;/R - (4&mu;/R)(dR/dt) ]
        </div>
        <p>
          Asymmetric bubble collapse near tissue surfaces generates supersonic localized liquid micro-jets (v<sub>jet</sub> = 150 to 350 m/s) and intense secondary pressure spikes. In plant biomass (grape pomace, citrus peels, microalgae), these micro-jets perforate lignocellulosic cell walls and disrupt plasma membranes, elevating the cell disintegration index (Z<sub>p</sub>) to over 0.85 and accelerating non-solvent polyphenol and anthocyanin extraction by 40% to 65%.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-ink flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 dark:bg-cyan-950 dark:text-cyan-300 inline-flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">4</span>
          Sanitary Isolation &amp; ASME Acoustic Containment
        </h4>
        <p>
          Commercial food-grade implementation requires strict adherence to USDA FSIS Directive 7120.1 and FDA 21 CFR § 117. Two critical design engineering safeguards are employed:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-xs text-muted">
          <li><strong>Acoustic-Transparent Sanitary Isolation Diaphragm:</strong> A flexible, high-tensile food-grade polyurethane membrane (FDA 21 CFR § 177.2600) separates the submerged spark electrode water bath from the food product chamber. This ensures zero product contact with trace tungsten/copper electrode erosion particles (&lt; 0.01 ppm) while allowing 98.5% shockwave transmission.</li>
          <li><strong>Dual-Wall Acoustic Attenuation Jacket:</strong> Submerged 200+ MPa acoustic discharges generate unattenuated noise levels exceeding 125 dB at 1 meter. Continuous skids incorporate viscoelastic polymer damping layers and air-gap acoustic resonators within an ASME Section VIII Div 1 pressure casing, reducing ambient operational sound levels to &lt; 74 dBA, well below OSHA’s 85 dBA 8-hour permissible exposure limit.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Benchmarking Table -->
  <div class="bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-xs space-y-6">
    <div class="border-b border-hairline pb-4">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">{d.tableTitle}</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">Comparing high-voltage arc hydrodynamic shockwaves against HPP, blade tenderization, enzymes, and conventional aging.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full text-left text-xs text-ink border-collapse">
        <thead>
          <tr class="border-b border-hairline bg-surface-elevated font-semibold text-muted uppercase tracking-wider">
            <th class="py-3 px-4">Technology</th>
            <th class="py-3 px-4">Process Dwell</th>
            <th class="py-3 px-4">WBSF Shear Reduction</th>
            <th class="py-3 px-4">Purge / Drip Loss</th>
            <th class="py-3 px-4">Thermal Cooking / Color</th>
            <th class="py-3 px-4">Specific Energy</th>
            <th class="py-3 px-4">Regulatory / Safety</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-hairline">
          {benchmarks.map((b, i) => (
            <tr class={i === 0 ? "bg-cyan-500/10 font-medium" : "hover:bg-surface-elevated/50 transition-colors"}>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-ink flex items-center gap-2">
                {i === 0 && <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500"></span>}
                {b.technology}
              </td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4">{b.processingTime}</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold">{b.wbsfShearForceReduction}</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4">{b.meatPurgeDripLoss}</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4">{b.thermalCookingArtifact}</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-mono">{b.specificEnergyKjKg}</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4">{b.regulatoryStatus}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script is:inline>
  (function initHvpModeler() {
    const systemSelect = document.getElementById('hvp-system-select');
    const substrateSelect = document.getElementById('hvp-substrate-select');
    const voltageInput = document.getElementById('hvp-voltage-input');
    const energyInput = document.getElementById('hvp-energy-input');
    const freqInput = document.getElementById('hvp-freq-input');
    const pulsesInput = document.getElementById('hvp-pulses-input');

    const voltageVal = document.getElementById('hvp-voltage-val');
    const energyVal = document.getElementById('hvp-energy-val');
    const freqVal = document.getElementById('hvp-freq-val');
    const pulsesVal = document.getElementById('hvp-pulses-val');

    const outPressure = document.getElementById('out-peak-pressure');
    const outVelocity = document.getElementById('out-shock-velocity');
    const outWbsf = document.getElementById('out-wbsf-reduction');
    const outWbsfNewtons = document.getElementById('out-wbsf-newtons');
    const outDisruption = document.getElementById('out-disruption-index');
    const outFlux = document.getElementById('out-energy-flux');
    const outMicrobial = document.getElementById('out-microbial-log');
    const outNetSec = document.getElementById('out-net-sec');
    const outNoise = document.getElementById('out-noise-level');
    const outNoiseDesc = document.getElementById('out-noise-desc');

    const statusBadge = document.getElementById('hvp-status-badge');
    const evalTitle = document.getElementById('hvp-eval-title');
    const evalDesc = document.getElementById('hvp-eval-desc');
    const evalBox = document.getElementById('hvp-evaluation-box');

    const presetButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.hvp-preset-btn');

    const SUBSTRATE_PROPS = {
      bovine_semitendinosus: { initWbsf: 58.5, targetWbsf: 34.0, zFactor: 0.038, imp: 1.62, category: 'meat' },
      spent_hen_fowl_breast: { initWbsf: 66.0, targetWbsf: 36.5, zFactor: 0.032, imp: 1.58, category: 'meat' },
      pork_loin_longissimus: { initWbsf: 46.2, targetWbsf: 26.8, zFactor: 0.045, imp: 1.61, category: 'meat' },
      grape_pomace_biomass: { initWbsf: 0, targetWbsf: 0, zFactor: 0.040, imp: 1.52, category: 'biomass' },
      microalgae_chlorella_slurry: { initWbsf: 0, targetWbsf: 0, zFactor: 0.046, imp: 1.51, category: 'biomass' },
      bivalve_eastern_oyster: { initWbsf: 0, targetWbsf: 0, zFactor: 0.080, imp: 1.64, category: 'shellfish' }
    };

    function recalculate() {
      const v = parseFloat(voltageInput.value);
      const e = parseFloat(energyInput.value);
      const f = parseFloat(freqInput.value);
      const n = parseInt(pulsesInput.value, 10);
      const subId = substrateSelect.value;
      const sub = SUBSTRATE_PROPS[subId] || SUBSTRATE_PROPS.bovine_semitendinosus;

      voltageVal.textContent = v.toFixed(1) + ' kV';
      energyVal.textContent = e.toFixed(1) + ' kJ';
      freqVal.textContent = f.toFixed(1) + ' Hz';
      pulsesVal.textContent = n + ' pulses';

      // 1. Peak Shockwave Pressure P_peak (MPa)
      // Hydrodynamic spark breakdown formula: P_peak = k * sqrt(E_pulse) * (V / V0)^0.8
      const pPeakMpa = Math.min(360, Math.round(52 * Math.sqrt(e) * Math.pow(v / 40, 0.85)));
      outPressure.textContent = pPeakMpa + ' MPa';

      // 2. Supersonic Hugoniot shock wave velocity u_s (m/s) in tissue
      // u_s = c0 + s * sqrt(2 * P_peak / rho)
      const uShockMs = Math.round(1500 + 1.85 * Math.sqrt((pPeakMpa * 1e6) / 1050) * 0.45);
      const mach = (uShockMs / 1500).toFixed(2);
      outVelocity.innerHTML = uShockMs.toLocaleString() + ' m/s <span class="text-xs text-muted font-mono">(Mach ' + mach + ')</span>';

      // 3. Acoustic Energy Flux Density E_a (J/cm2 per pulse)
      const energyFlux = (e * 0.82 / (Math.PI * Math.pow(3.5, 2))).toFixed(1);
      outFlux.textContent = energyFlux + ' J/cm²';

      // 4. Myofibrillar Disruption / Cell Permeabilization Z_p (%)
      // Z_p = 1 - exp(-k * N * (P_peak / 100)^1.2)
      const zp = Math.min(0.96, 1 - Math.exp(-sub.zFactor * n * Math.pow(pPeakMpa / 120, 1.15)));
      const disruptionPercent = (zp * 100).toFixed(1);
      outDisruption.innerHTML = disruptionPercent + '% <span class="text-xs text-muted font-mono">Zp = ' + zp.toFixed(2) + '</span>';

      // 5. WBSF Shear Force Reduction
      if (sub.category === 'meat') {
        const wbsfDropFraction = Math.min(0.56, zp * 0.52);
        const finalWbsf = (sub.initWbsf * (1 - wbsfDropFraction)).toFixed(1);
        const dropPercent = (-wbsfDropFraction * 100).toFixed(1);
        outWbsf.textContent = dropPercent + '%';
        outWbsfNewtons.textContent = finalWbsf + ' N (from ' + sub.initWbsf + ' N)';
      } else if (sub.category === 'biomass') {
        outWbsf.textContent = '+' + (zp * 58).toFixed(1) + '%';
        outWbsfNewtons.textContent = 'Polyphenol Yield Lift';
      } else {
        outWbsf.textContent = (zp * 100 > 85 ? '99.2%' : '82.4%');
        outWbsfNewtons.textContent = 'Adductor Shuck Rate';
      }

      // 6. Surface Microbial Log Reduction (UV flash + OH radical)
      const logKill = Math.min(3.8, (0.45 + 0.08 * n * (v / 40))).toFixed(2);
      outMicrobial.textContent = logKill + ' log';

      // 7. Net Specific Energy Consumption SEC (kJ/kg)
      // SEC = (E_pulse * N_pulses) / kg_dose
      const secKjKg = ((e * n) / 30).toFixed(1);
      const kwhKg = (parseFloat(secKjKg) / 3600).toFixed(4);
      outNetSec.innerHTML = secKjKg + ' kJ/kg <span class="text-xs text-muted font-mono">(' + kwhKg + ' kWh/kg)</span>';

      // 8. Acoustic Noise & Safety Containment
      const baseDba = 68.0;
      const noiseLevel = Math.min(92, baseDba + 3.5 * Math.log2(Math.max(1, f)) + 4.2 * (v / 40) - 2.5);
      const noiseRounded = noiseLevel.toFixed(1);
      outNoise.textContent = noiseRounded + ' dBA';

      const oshaMargin = (85.0 - noiseLevel).toFixed(1);

      // Diagnostics & Status
      if (v > 50 && e > 25) {
        statusBadge.className = 'px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-red-100 text-red-800 dark:bg-red-950 dark:text-red-300 border border-red-300 dark:border-red-700';
        statusBadge.textContent = 'OVERVOLTAGE ARC EROSION HAZARD';
        evalBox.className = 'p-4 rounded-xl bg-red-950/20 border border-red-800/40 text-xs leading-relaxed space-y-1.5 text-slate-300';
        evalTitle.textContent = 'Excessive Spark Plasma Energy & Electrode Spalling Hazard';
        evalDesc.textContent = 'Discharge voltage exceeding 50 kV with pulse energy > 25 kJ produces excessive electrode tip spalling (> 2.8 µg/pulse) and cavitation overpressure (> 320 MPa), accelerating acoustic membrane fatigue and causing unnecessary meat shredding.';
        outNoiseDesc.textContent = oshaMargin + ' dBA OSHA headroom (Warning: Near 80 dBA)';
        outNoiseDesc.className = 'text-[10px] text-amber-500 font-semibold';
      } else if (pPeakMpa < 120 || n < 10) {
        statusBadge.className = 'px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 dark:bg-amber-950 dark:text-amber-300 border border-amber-300 dark:border-amber-700';
        statusBadge.textContent = 'SUB-OPTIMAL TENDERIZATION';
        evalBox.className = 'p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-950/20 border border-amber-800/40 text-xs leading-relaxed space-y-1.5 text-slate-300';
        evalTitle.textContent = 'Insufficient Acoustic Shock Amplitude';
        evalDesc.textContent = 'Acoustic shockwave amplitude (< 120 MPa) or pulse dose (< 10 pulses) is insufficient to shatter dense myofibrillar cross-bridges and collagen sheaths. Increase pulse energy or exposure dwell.';
        outNoiseDesc.textContent = oshaMargin + ' dBA OSHA safety headroom';
        outNoiseDesc.className = 'text-[10px] text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold';
      } else {
        statusBadge.className = 'px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-950 dark:text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-300 dark:border-emerald-700';
        statusBadge.textContent = 'OPTIMAL TENDERIZATION & RUPTURE';
        evalBox.className = 'p-4 rounded-xl bg-cyan-950/20 border border-cyan-800/40 text-xs leading-relaxed space-y-1.5 text-slate-300';
        evalTitle.textContent = 'Optimal Continuous Shockwave Window';
        evalDesc.textContent = 'Focused 200–280 MPa acoustic pulses cleanly shatter structural I-bands and Z-disks without heat artifacts (ΔT < 1.2°C). Drip purge loss is preserved (< 1.2%) while acoustic attenuation remains safely below OSHA 85 dBA limits.';
        outNoiseDesc.textContent = oshaMargin + ' dBA OSHA safety headroom';
        outNoiseDesc.className = 'text-[10px] text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold';
      }
    }

    [systemSelect, substrateSelect, voltageInput, energyInput, freqInput, pulsesInput].forEach(el => {
      if (el) el.addEventListener('input', recalculate);
    });

    presetButtons.forEach(btn => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const p = btn.getAttribute('data-preset');
        if (p === 'beef') {
          substrateSelect.value = 'bovine_semitendinosus';
          voltageInput.value = '42';
          energyInput.value = '18';
          freqInput.value = '4';
          pulsesInput.value = '24';
        } else if (p === 'poultry') {
          substrateSelect.value = 'spent_hen_fowl_breast';
          voltageInput.value = '38';
          energyInput.value = '14';
          freqInput.value = '4';
          pulsesInput.value = '30';
        } else if (p === 'pomace') {
          substrateSelect.value = 'grape_pomace_biomass';
          voltageInput.value = '40';
          energyInput.value = '16';
          freqInput.value = '6';
          pulsesInput.value = '35';
        } else if (p === 'oyster') {
          substrateSelect.value = 'bivalve_eastern_oyster';
          voltageInput.value = '34';
          energyInput.value = '12';
          freqInput.value = '3';
          pulsesInput.value = '4';
        } else if (p === 'hazard') {
          substrateSelect.value = 'bovine_semitendinosus';
          voltageInput.value = '52';
          energyInput.value = '28';
          freqInput.value = '6';
          pulsesInput.value = '48';
        }
        recalculate();
      });
    });

    recalculate();
  })();
</script>
